  <p class="lede">
    Batteries need different handling from general e-waste — different transport rules, different storage precautions, different downstream processing. This page covers how battery pickup is booked separately from general pickup, what to do with swollen or damaged batteries before the team arrives, and how bulk battery batches (from offices with UPS/inverter systems) get scheduled.
  </p>

